FreeType 2.14.2 (https://freetype.org), trimmed for my-client's text renderer
(frontend/font_text.*): include/ as released, and src/base, src/truetype, src/sfnt and
src/smooth. Built by the top-level CMakeLists.txt as the `freetype` static library with
config/my_ftoption.h (FT_CONFIG_OPTIONS_H: the upstream ftoption.h with the lines marked
"my-client: off" turned off, among them TT_CONFIG_OPTION_SUBPIXEL_HINTING, so the TrueType
hinter is the v35 interpreter, full hinting as GDI does it) and config/my_ftmodule.h
(FT_CONFIG_MODULES_H).

